WEBVTT

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:31.845
this is the Linux world headquarters.

00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:33.859
(Laughter)

00:00:33.883 --> 00:00:37.889
(Applause)

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:40.199
Linus Torvalds: It really
doesn't look like much.

00:00:40.223 --> 00:00:41.899
And I have to say,

00:00:41.923 --> 00:00:45.743
the most interesting part in this picture,

00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:47.470
that people mostly react to,

00:00:47.494 --> 00:00:48.937
is the walking desk.

00:00:48.961 --> 00:00:51.660
It is the most interesting
part in my office

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.644
and I'm not actually using it anymore.

00:00:53.668 --> 00:00:55.960
And I think the two things are related.

00:00:57.206 --> 00:00:59.531
The way I work is ...